\":\"Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare’s famous tragedy.\\n \\nTrapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question – you know the one.\\n \\nNational Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky’s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.\",\"starring\":\"Hiran Abeysekera\",\"directedBy\":\"Robert Hastie\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":177,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"-BvAjhBQnDo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-22\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-22\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"475714\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Lrc Hamlet - NT Live 2026 (Theatre) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"364657\",\"time\":\"2025-11-06T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362957\",\"time\":\"2026-01-22T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":45,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362958\",\"time\":\"2026-02-02T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":10,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":91,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362959\",\"time\":\"2026-02-18T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":17,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":84,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"33017\",\"name\":\"The SpongeBob Movie: Search For SquarePants\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-spongebob-movie-search-for-squarepants\",\"posterImage\":\"yfhwo5rd4tkxn9k0mftb50s8oc6h\",\"bannerImage\":\"zlojyipasph5r3liko4lopk3oq17\",\"synopsis\":\"SpongeBob and his Bikini Bottom friends set sail in their biggest, all-new, can’t miss cinematic event ever…The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants. Desperate to be a big guy, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following The Flying Dutchman – a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate – on a seafaring comedy-adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep sea, where no Sponge has gone before.\",\"starring\":\"Tom Kenny, Clancy Brown, Rodger Bumpass\",\"directedBy\":\"Derek Drymon\",\"producedBy\":\"Pam Brady, Lisa Stewart, Aaron Dem\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":96,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"wFx7DRIKaig\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":202.548,\"tmdbId\":\"991494\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"376637\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SPONGEBOB MOVIE: SEARCH FOR SQUAREPANTS, THE [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"381579\",\"time\":\"2025-12-20T13:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":54,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381580\",\"time\":\"2025-12-20T15:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":22,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":38,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381602\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T10:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381601\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381600\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T15:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381610\",\"time\":\"2025-12-22T10:35:00Z\",\"ticketsSo