1-25T10:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391942\",\"time\":\"2026-02-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391943\",\"time\":\"2026-02-22T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31214\",\"name\":\"Bring Your Own Baby Comedy Club\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"bring-your-own-baby-comedy-club\",\"posterImage\":\"hjhgts1l8870cv04to1o8rgfhqpb\",\"bannerImage\":\"9ywkwzecy92jnf8xfr7xhpsqwtue\",\"synopsis\":\"WINNER: Best bring-along Baby Event (HOOP Awards)\\nWINNER: Comedy Club of the Year 2024 (Innovation and Excellence Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Mental Health Boost for New Parents 2022 (UK Enterprise Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Comedy Event for Families 2023 (Prestige Awards)\\nNOMINATED: Feed With Confidence Award 2018\\n\\n“Yaaaas! This is the maternity leave I have dreamed of!” – Michelle, BYOB Guest\\n\\n“Bring Your Own Baby Comedy has transformed parental leave” – i paper\\n\\u2028\\nJoin us for an afternoon of hilarious comedy, where you can relax and have a good laugh at the best comedians in the UK, without needing childcare! There’s buggy parking, baby changing so that you can take some time for yourself and just be entertained. The bar is fully stocked, whether you fancy a cuppa or even something a bit stronger (G\\u0026T anyone?). If you need to whip out a bum (the baby’s please!), a boob or a bottle, then please feel free… and our comics won’t mind being heckled by our younger guests!*\\n\\nEach show features two brilliant comedians plus a compere, and the whole show will last approx. 75 minutes including an interval.\\n\\n*Please note that we have a 15-month age limit for our little laughers, as our comedians will be performing their usual grown-up jokes!\\n\\n*Please note that buggies cannot be brought into the performance space with you so please bring a sling if your baby would like to relax during the show\\n* If you are coming with twins or have any additional needs, please contact our friendly team at info@byobcomedy.com\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362962\",\"time\":\"2025-12-09T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":73,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":52,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362963\",\"time\":\"2026-02-10T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":105,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394890\",\"time\":\"2026-04-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394891\",\"time\":\"2026-06-09T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394892\",\"time\":\"2026-09-15T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394893\",\"time\":\"2026-10-27T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394894\",\"time\":\"2026-12-08T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seats