e on London’s West End.\",\"starring\":\"Jack Lowden, Martin Freeman\",\"directedBy\":\"Finn den Hertog\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":85,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":\"\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"WLV4Ho-eCTo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-27\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-11-18\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"475713\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Lrc Fifth Step - NT Live 2025 (Theatre), The [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362926\",\"time\":\"2025-11-18T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":30,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362927\",\"time\":\"2025-11-27T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":101,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":0,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362928\",\"time\":\"2025-12-01T14:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":98,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":3,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"372676\",\"time\":\"2025-12-03T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":40,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":61,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362929\",\"time\":\"2025-12-09T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":97,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":4,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"386647\",\"time\":\"2026-01-19T18:05:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":32,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":28,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394038\",\"time\":\"2026-02-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":10,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29184\",\"name\":\"Bugonia\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"bugonia\",\"posterImage