e (Éanna Hardwicke) and his national team manager Mick McCarthy (Steve Coogan) during the Irish team’s preparations for the 2002 FIFA World Cup. \\n\\nThe intense rivalry between these two personalities transcended the game, gripping an entire nation and the sporting world as a whole. On the surface, the feud was all about standards, but deep down it was an incredible story of two men whose rivalry and contempt surpassed the sport they loved. This is the definitive account of one of the most fractious fallings-out in the history of sport.\",\"starring\":\"Éanna Hardwicke, Steve Coogan, Oliver Coopersmith\",\"directedBy\":\"Lisa Barros D'Sa, Glenn Leyburn\",\"producedBy\":\"Trevor Birney, Macdara Kelleher, Oliver Butler, John Keville\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":91,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, History\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"s4TzwHPsq_s\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-02\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.4078,\"tmdbId\":\"1322692\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"471559\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SAIPAN [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393898\",\"time\":\"2026-01-30T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389688\",\"time\":\"2026-02-01T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":49,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389689\",\"time\":\"2026-02-02T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":55,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34249\",\"name\":\"Is This Thing On?\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"is-this-thing-on\",\"posterImage\":\"xxnbn1j797aew62r08my906f2q69\",\"bannerImage\":\"lt3l9z7nb7d4gutnx36nhxo90aiu\",\"synopsis\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex (Will Arnett) faces middle age and an impending divorce, seeking new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess (Laura Dern) confronts the sacrifices she made for their family—forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\",\"starring\":\"Will Arnett, Laura Dern, Andra Day\",\"directedBy\":\"Bradley Cooper\",\"producedBy\":\"Bradley Cooper, Will Arnett, Kris Thykier, Weston Middleton\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":121,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.1212,\"tmdbId\":\"1140498\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"480188\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Is This Thing On? [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393887\",\"time\":\"2026-01-30T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":99,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393379\",\"time\":\"2026-01-30T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":117,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394037\",\"time\":\"2026-01-31T11:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393910\",\"time\":\"2026-01-31T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393382\",\"time\":\"2026-01-31T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":123,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393919\",\"time\":\"2026-02-01T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393383\",\"time\":\"2026-02-01T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":124,