pped in a car under fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue.\\nWhile trying to keep her on the line, they do everything they can to get an ambulance to her.\\nHer name was Hind Rajab.\",\"starring\":\"Motaz Malhees, Saja Kilani, Amer Hlehel\",\"directedBy\":\"Kaouther Ben Hania\",\"producedBy\":\"Odessa Rae, James Wilson, Nadim Cheikhrouha\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":89,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7udC9c6Cfis\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-06\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":15.9186,\"tmdbId\":\"1480382\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"480746\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Voice Of Hind Rajab, The [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"389692\",\"time\":\"2026-02-06T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389693\",\"time\":\"2026-02-08T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":47,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"389694\",\"time\":\"2026-02-09T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34250\",\"name\":\"Goat\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"goat\",\"posterImage\":\"n0xu4gtrottegywx0rb0rf9yvq2i\",\"bannerImage\":\"tfthx1u9hgl605jp14nuhdt8yrtw\",\"synopsis\":\"From Sony Pictures Animation, the studio behind Spider-ManTM: Across the Spider-Verse and the artists that made KPop Demon Hunters, comes GOAT, an original action-comedy set in an all-animal world. The story follows Will, a small goat with big dreams who gets a once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball – a high-intensity, co-ed, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest, fiercest animals in the world. Will’s new teammates aren’t thrilled about having a little goat on their roster, but Will is determined to revolutionize the sport and prove once and for all that “smalls can ball!”\",\"starring\":\"Caleb McLaughlin, Gabrielle Union, Jenifer Lewis\",\"directedBy\":\"Tyree Dillihay\",\"producedBy\":\"Stephen Curry, Rodney Rothman, Michelle Raimo Kouyate, Adam Rosenberg, Erick Peyton\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":100,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family, Comedy, Animation\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"fXVvRyhLsO8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":15.6559,\"tmdbId\":\"1297842\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"421296\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"GOAT [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393385\",\"time\":\"2026-02-07T13:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393386\",\"time\":\"2026-02-08T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393389\",\"time\":\"2026-02-14T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393388\",\"time\":\"2026-02-14T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393387\",\"time\":\"2026-02-14T15:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393392\",\"time\":\"2026-02-15T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393391\",\"time\":\"2026-02-15T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393390\",\"time\":\"2026-02-15T15:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34100\",\"name\":\"The Bride Wore Black [La Mariée était en Noir]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-bride-wore-black-la-marie-tait-en-noir\",\"posterImage\":\"gezffb8d6u8dro67q9xgaowmvbk9\",\"bannerImage\":\"1y3cp5jvmgqhajminzdfzvjjal72\",\"synopsis\":\"Le jour de son mariage, alors qu'elle sort à peine de l'Eglise, Julie voit son mari assassiné sous ses yeux... Personne ne sait pourquoi l'homme était la cible de cette balle. La veuve va alors entreprendre un voyage pour se venger de ceux qui ont tué son mari. Elle tient une liste des cinq responsables et elle compte les éliminer un par un.\\n\\nOn her wedding day, as she was leaving the church, Julie witnessed her husband's murder. No one knew why he had been targeted. The widow then embarked on a journey to avenge her husband's death. She kept a list of the five people responsible and planned to eliminate them one by one.\",\"starring\":\"Jeanne Moreau, Michel Bouquet, Jean-Claude Brialy, Charles Denner, Claude Rich, Michael Lonsdale, Daniel Boulange, Alexandra Stewart.\",\"directedBy\":\"Francois Truffaut\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":107,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GGXGkAATl0Y\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-07\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"22348\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Egreti Gelin - The Pseudo Bride (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391934\",\"time\":\"2026-02-07T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":26,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":75,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34093\",\"name\":\"Lilo \\u0026 Stitch\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"lilo-stitch\",\"posterImage\":\"5ozpkqfmagorn53pvia6c6orj543\",\"bannerImage\":\"hrek1eqdm2hzxn54l8v1vrorqymj\",\"synopsis\":\"A live-action reimagining of Disney’s 2002 animated classic, “Lilo \\u0026 Stitch” is the wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family. Directed by Dean Fleischer Camp, the Oscar®-nominated filmmaker behind the animated feature film “Marcel the Shell with Shoes On,” the film stars Sydney Elizebeth Agudong, Billy Magnussen, Tia Carrere, Hannah Waddingham, Chris Sanders, with Courtney B. Vance, and Zach Galifianakis, introducing Maia Kealoha. “Lilo \\u0026 Stitch” is produced by Jonathan Eirich, p.g.a. and Dan Lin, with Louie Provost, Tom Peitzman and Ryan Halprin serving as executive producers.\",\"starring\":\"Maia Kealoha, Sydney Agudong, Chris Sanders\",\"directedBy\":\"Dean Fleischer Camp\",\"producedBy\":\"Dan Lin, Jonathan Eirich\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":108,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family, Science Fiction, Comedy\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"pKmKt8mPAL4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":20.2465,\"tmdbId\":\"552524\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"381440\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Lilo \\u0026amp; Stitch [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391940\",\"time\":\"2026-02-07T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391941\",\"time\":\"2026-02-08T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":88,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34447\",\"name\":\"Sinners\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"sinners\",\"posterImage\":\"qpr0n7frkmp9mlxsadkscxx0wtdk\",\"bannerImage\":\"r8zxlw81ebg87danzbjeimb8qwl9\",\"synopsis\":\"From Ryan Coogler—director of “Black Panther” and “Creed”—and starring Michael B. Jordan comes a new vision of fear: “Sinners.” \\n\\nTrying to leave their troubled lives behind, twin brothers (Jordan) return to their hometown to start again, only to discover that an even greater evil is waiting to welcome them back.\",\"starring\":\"Michael B. Jordan, Jack O'Connell, Delroy Lindo, Omar Benson Miller, Wunmi Mosaku, Hailee Steinfeld\",\"directedBy\":\"Ryan Coogler\",\"producedBy\":\"Ryan Coogler, Sev Ohanian, Zinzi Coogler\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":138,\"genre\":\"Horror\",\"allGenres\":\"Horror, Thriller\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"4oqCwr_bzHI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-18\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":6.98,\"tmdbId\":\"1233413\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"371755\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Sinners (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395201\",\"time\":\"2026-02-07T14:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395202\",\"time\":\"2026-02-12T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29172\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Woolf Works\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-woolf-works\",\"posterImage\":\"huvzaegvdgsoydxpc9dmyc8f78mv\",\"bannerImage\":\"m1z48j07nwnompp2d8e4f72c2qfj\",\"synopsis\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality.\\nResident Choreographer Wayne McGregor leads a luminous artistic team to evoke Woolf’s signature stream of consciousness writing style in this immense work that rejects traditional narrative structures.\\nWoolf Works is a collage of themes from Mrs Dalloway, Orlando, The Waves and Woolf’s other writings.\\nCreated in 2015 for The Royal Ballet, this Olivier-award winning ballet triptych captures the heart of Woolf’s uniquely artistic spirit.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"OdEztPc-wuM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.2107,\"tmdbId\":\"1483685\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466188\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"WOOLF WORKS - ROH, LONDON 2026 (BALLET) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362946\",\"time\":\"2026-02-09T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":57,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":44,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362947\",\"time\":\"2026-02-16T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":14,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":87,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34448\",\"name\":\"I Swear\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"i-swear\",\"posterImage\":\"4tahhcycg51fditkup2qre1cn110\",\"bannerImage\":\"1gglsrk2r4wfmznrepoz9vp3rwtz\",\"synopsis\":\"Diagnosed with Tourette’s at age 15, John Davidson faced and overcame many hardships from adolescence and early adulthood as a result of what was a little known and entirely misunderstood condition in 1980’s Britain. I SWEAR is a funny, heartfelt and moving account of John’s experiences.\",\"starring\":\"Robert Aramayo, Shirley Henderson, Maxine Peake, Peter Mullan\",\"directedBy\":\"Kirk Jones\",\"producedBy\":\"Kirk Jones, Piers Tempest, Georgia Bayliff\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, History\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"oeWqQN3snCU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.1413,\"tmdbId\":\"1317149\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"475487\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"I SWEAR [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395205\",\"time\":\"2026-02-09T17:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395206\",\"time\":\"2026-02-11T14:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser silver-screen-\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34451\",\"name\":\"The Ballad Of Wallis Island\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-ballad-of-wallis-island-2\",\"posterImage\":\"22pih1q36guqfer1wqoexc744mph\",\"bannerImage\":\"86eccizyfmrmruriz9pjf5yyvn4f\",\"synopsis\":\"The Ballad of Wallis Island follows Charles (Tim Key), an eccentric lottery winner who lives alone on a remote island and dreams of getting his favourite musicians, Mortimer-McGwyer (Carey Mulligan and Tom Basden) back together. His fantasy quickly turns into reality when the bandmates and former lovers accept his invitation to play a show at his home on Wallis Island. Old tensions resurface as Charles tries desperately to salvage his dream gig.\",\"starring\":\"Carey Mulligan, Tom Basden, Tim Key\",\"directedBy\":\"James Griffiths\",\"producedBy\":\"Sarah Monteith\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":100,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"T9smxlnKNz0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.863,\"tmdbId\":\"1122099\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"458833\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Ballad Of Wallis Island, The [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395207\",\"time\":\"2026-02-11T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"silver-screen-\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395208\",\"time\":\"2026-02-12T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\"