he French New Wave.\",\"starring\":\"Guillaume Marbeck, Zoey Deutch, Aubry Dullin\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Linklater\",\"producedBy\":\"Michèle Pétin, Laurent Pétin\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":106,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama, History\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"sRqWbsdACzg\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":6.8986,\"tmdbId\":\"1254808\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466065\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Nouvelle Vague [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"392296\",\"time\":\"2026-02-20T17:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"392297\",\"time\":\"2026-02-21T17:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"392298\",\"time\":\"2026-02-22T20:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"392299\",\"time\":\"2026-02-25T10:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34255\",\"name\":\"The Secret Agent\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-secret-agent\",\"posterImage\":\"gqoxogvbc1e2y9o4sypchlycad3f\",\"bannerImage\":\"nqk2ivolll2ofleekpvaj7xqktoq\",\"synopsis\":\"THE SECRET AGENT is a mischievous political thriller from Kleber Mendonça Filho, starring Wagner Moura and set against the charged atmosphere of 1970s Brazil.\",\"starring\":\"Wagner Moura, Carlos Francisco, Tânia Maria\",\"directedBy\":\"Kleber Mendonça Filho\",\"producedBy\":\"Emilie Lesclaux, Kleber Mendonça Filho\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":161,\"genre\":\"Crime\",\"allGenres\":\"Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"WsE1PLxfPnU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-20\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":23.5157,\"tmdbId\":\"1220564\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"470875\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Secret Agent, The [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395209\",\"time\":\"2026-02-20T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395210\",\"time\":\"2026-02-20T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395211\",\"time\":\"2026-02-23T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34335\",\"name\":\"Whiplash\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"whiplash\",\"posterImage\":\"hfidzjxwmxpjpcl5wpjmw83iakqo\",\"bannerImage\":\"t0btao25a0kvayvb865iiagklr4w\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins for Best Film Editing, Best Sound Mixing, Best Supporting Actor\\nAcademy Award Nominations for Best Picture, Best Supporting Actor, Best Adapted Screenplay, Best Film Editing, Best Sound Mixing \\n\\nAndrew Meyman is a 19-year-old jazz drummer, dreaming of greatness but unsure if his dream will ever come true. Haunted by the failed writing career of his father, Andrew is determined to rise to the top of the country's most elite music conservatory. One night, Terence Fletcher, a conductor equally known for his talent for teaching as he is for the terrifying method of his instruction, discovers Andrew practicing the drums. Even though Fletcher says very little to him that night, he ignites in Andrew a passion to achieve his goal. To Andrew's surprise, the next day, Fletcher requests that he be transferred into his band. This single act changes the young man's life forever.\",\"starring\":\"Miles Teller, J.K. Simmons, Melissa Benoist\",\"directedBy\":\"Damien Chazelle\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":106,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7d_jQycdQGo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-24\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-24\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"98995\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394973\",\"time\":\"2026-02-24T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"32519\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Audience\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"national-theatre-live-the-audience\",\"posterImage\":\"31nnkask5snufa18l0m54xe149w5\",\"bannerImage\":\"h241aimasi5uava4f00agkmhp3tx\",\"synopsis\":\"Returning to cinemas for the first time in over a decade, Helen Mirren plays Queen Elizabeth II in the Olivier and Tony Award® -winning hit production, directed by Stephen Daldry.\\nFor 60 years, Queen Elizabeth II met with each of her 12 prime ministers in a private weekly meeting. This meeting is known as The Audience. From Winston Churchill to Margaret Thatcher and David Cameron, the Queen advised her prime ministers on matters both public and personal. Through these private audiences, we see glimpses of the woman behind the crown and witness the moments that shaped a monarch.\\n\\nPeter Morgan’s Netflix phenomenon The Crown was based on this hit play that was captured live from London’s West End in 2013 and went on to become one of the most-watched NT Live productions\",\"starring\":\"Helen Mirren, Michael Elwyn, Haydn Gwynne\",\"directedBy\":\"Robin Lough\",\"producedBy\":\"Emma Keith\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":122,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"K4hIMnOXGhI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-26\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.5223,\"tmdbId\":\"209149\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466999\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"UNTITLED NT LIVE EVENT (19TH FEB 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"375801\",\"time\":\"2026-02-26T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":32,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":69,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34094\",\"name\":\"Sonic The Hedgehog 3\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"sonic-the-hedgehog-3\",\"posterImage\":\"y3j8y7j00ydn3f66jsh1s0m5y69c\",\"bannerImage\":\"fzpo9kgmhc4ujr6wj6m4h0gyi3j2\",\"synopsis\":\"Sonic the Hedgehog returns to the big screen this holiday season in his most thrilling adventure yet. Sonic, Knuckles, and Tails reunite against a powerful new adversary, Shadow, a mysterious villain with powers unlike anything they have faced before. With their abilities outmatched in every way, Team Sonic must seek out an unlikely alliance in hopes of stopping Shadow and protecting the planet.\",\"starring\":\"Jim Carrey, Ben Schwartz, Keanu Reeves\",\"directedBy\":\"Jeff Fowler\",\"producedBy\":\"Neal H. Moritz, Toby Ascher, Toru Nakahara, Hitoshi Okuno\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":110,\"genre\":\"Science Fiction\",\"allGenres\":\"Science Fiction, Family, Comedy, Adventure\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"AcPm1c7_vKY\",\"trailerVideo\":\"ijefk8qiuo6150g82p5c9sp0vv44\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-27\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-28\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":18.7482,\"tmdbId\":\"939243\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"368908\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Sonic The Hedgehog 3 (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391944\",\"time\":\"2026-02-28T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391945\",\"time\":\"2026-03-01T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34359\",\"name\":\"Film Club Awards Panel 2026\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"film-club-awards-panel-2026\",\"posterImage\":\"52v1dcwgw72orvemv8wxtk0o46hs\",\"bannerImage\":\"q4hzdnhy64xlggn55k3kydm5a3j6\",\"synopsis\":\"Join a panel of industry experts in our annual awards panel. Host Andrea Carnevali and the panellists debate the nominated films and offer you your chance to share your views. Film Club returns across 2026 where you can dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. Featuring a friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nSeparate tickets are available for the BAFTA Best Picture winner following the panel.\\n\\nAbout Andrea Carnevali: \\n\\nAbout Enrico Tessarin: \\n\\nAbout Clarisse Loughrey: The chief film critic for The Independent and co-host of the Fade to Black podcast.\\n\\nAbout Sarah Cook: A freelance film journalist and film festival digital marketing manager.  She is also a historical fiction author who has written several books including Diary of Murders, A Maze of Monsters \\u0026 Men, and The Elaborations. She is obsessed with the Victorian era. In her spare time, Sarah is an active member of the Victorian Society and likes to explore the weird wonders of the UK. She lives with her two cats Jekyll and Bennett in Northamptonshire.\\nFollow her on all the socials: @sarahcookwrites\\n\\nAbout Rob Sprackling: An award-winning screenwriter and director. He conceived and co-wrote the original screenplay for Disney’s GNOMEO \\u0026 JULIET starring Emily Blunt and James McAvoy with music by Elton John. It was number one in most territories worldwide and took $200m at the box office. He conceived and co-wrote the animated feature THE QUEENS CORGI for nWave, starring Jack Whitehall. It took $50m at the worldwide box office and was number one in France and the Netherlands. He conceived, wrote and is currently co-directing an original animated feature FLAMINGO FLAMENCO for Studio100 tipped as one of the '26 to watch in 2026' by Animation Magazine. He wrote the animated feature HEIDI: RESCUE OF THE LYNX which came out in cinemas worldwide in 2025 and has been nominated for numerous awards. He also wrote the screenplay for the animated movie RALLY FROM PARIS TO THE PYRAMIDS (aka FLAKLYPA) which came out in its home territory of Norway on Christmas Day 2025 with the biggest opening weekend of the year. He has written for most Hollywood Studios including Disney and Dreamworks and for Working Title, BBC Films and Aardman Animation in the UK, including punch ups on the Oscar nominated SHAUN THE SHEEP movie and EARLY MAN.  He conceived and wrote the live action comedy feature MIKE BASSETT: ENGLAND MANAGER which was one of the top 5 British films in the UK in the year of its release. He subsequently co-wrote and exec produced the spinoff sitcom for ITV which averaged 3 million viewers per episode.  He has directed three multi-award winning short films and wrote the children's book BORN AGAIN BEN which was optioned by Paramount Pictures.\",\"starring\":\"Andrea Carnevali, Clarisse Loughrey, Sarah Cook, Rob Sprackling.\",\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":75,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-02\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"197447\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"2016 Miscellaneous Films (2D) [18]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394984\",\"time\":\"2026-03-02T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"qa ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34453\",\"name\":\"BAFTA 2026 Best Picture Winner\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"bafta-2026-best-picture-winner\",\"posterImage\":\"bywxu19zj4c9t0zt9fx0v9g1jfpg\",\"bannerImage\":\"bxrc7tsv0b97mho4agph1j3py4sy\",\"synopsis\":\"We'll screen the BAFTA Best Picture winner after our Awards Panel concludes. Max ticket price £12. Film to be confirmed post BAFTA ceremony (Feb 22nd).\\n\\nNominees:\\nHAMNET\\nMARTY SUPREME\\nONE BATTLE AFTER ANOTHER\\nSENTIMENTAL VALUE\\nSINNERS\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":180,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-02\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"179853\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Bafta Shorts (2015) (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395214\",\"time\":\"2026-03-02T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29173\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Giselle\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-giselle\",\"posterImage\":\"x8p9vzvlmvvlxmj0xd31j8gsibi0\",\"bannerImage\":\"mcvwy1etpaz5hr0es117vsvgq2bk\",\"synopsis\":\"The peasant girl Giselle has fallen in love with Albrecht.\\nWhen she discovers that he is actually a nobleman promised to another, she kills herself in despair. Her spirit joins the Wilis: the vengeful ghosts of women hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death.\\nWracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle’s grave, where he must face the Wilis – and Giselle’s ghost.\\nPeter Wright’s 1985 production of this quintessential Romantic ballet is a classic of The Royal Ballet repertory.\\nSet to Adolphe Adam’s evocative score and with atmospheric designs by John Macfarlane,\\nGiselle conjures up the earthly and otherworldly realms in a tale of love, betrayal and redemption.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7T_A4S3PWnE\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0071,\"tmdbId\":\"1385864\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466189\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"GISELLE - ROH, LONDON 2026 (BALLET) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362949\",\"time\":\"2026-03-03T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":30,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":71,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362950\",\"time\":\"2026-03-09T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34136\",\"name\":\"AURORA: What Happened To The Earth?\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"aurora-what-happened-to-the-earth\",\"posterImage\":\"bjry0ffzky9q19643og4mr8rn9fp\",\"bannerImage\":\"ijqi8dwz0qyz7xb94nbe7unefjpf\",\"synopsis\":\"Norwegian alt-pop artist AURORA, plays her biggest ever headline performance at Mexico City’s Palacio de los Deportes as part of her What Happened To The Earth? Tour. Filmed on Dia De Los Muertos (Day Of The Dead), the arena is transformed into a space of spellbinding sound and light, and filled with fans in festive dress. AURORA’s ethereal voice is ever-captivating as she sings haunting ballads including Dreams and Exist for Love as well as fan-favourites Runaway, The Seed and Churchyard. Known for blending electronic pop with folk and vivid storytelling, AURORA’s performances are always immersive and emotional, and this concert – celebrating nature and the human experience – solidifies her as a beacon of originality and inspiration.\",\"starring\":\"AURORA, Amalie Holt Kleive, Fredrik Svabø, Sigmund Vestrheim, Thea Emilie Wang\",\"directedBy\":\"Gonzalo Lopez\",\"producedBy\":\"David Roma, Mercury Studios and Jamila Scot\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":95,\"genre\":\"Concert\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":null,\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-04\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"491420\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled Trafalgar Event (4Th Mar 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"392237\",\"time\":\"2026-03-04T20:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":53,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"392238\",\"time\":\"2026-03-08T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"32819\",\"name\":\"Othello\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"othello-2\",\"posterImage\":\"7jpuiccy2p99vrio0givmd1tfsot\",\"bannerImage\":\"1moembakgpl1g2nstqg5zkv9jihf\",\"synopsis\":\"Shakespeare’s OTHELLO rages to life like never before in a ‘compelling’ (★★★★ Telegraph) newproduction starring David Harewood OBE (Homeland, Best of Enemies), Toby Jones OBE (Mr Bates vs the Post Office, Detectorists), Caitlin FitzGerald (Succession, Masters of Sex), Vinette Robinson (Boiling Point) and Luke Treadaway (A Street Cat Named Bob).Directed by Tony Award-winner Tom Morris OBE (War Horse, Dr Semmelweis, The Grinning Man) withmusic by PJ Harvey, this epic story of manipulation, jealousy and toxic masculinity explores the darker side of power, rage and desire. Filmed live at the Theatre Royal Haymarket in London especially for thebig screen, this is ‘an electrifying star-studded Othello.’ (★★★★ Mail on Sunday)\",\"starring\":\"David Harewood, Toby Jones, Caitlin Fitzgerald, Vinette Robinson, Luke Treadaway\",\"directedBy\":\"Tom Morris\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":165,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"MMFenDIr96Q\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"491420\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled Trafalgar Event (4Th/8Th Mar 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"379837\",\"time\":\"2026-03-05T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":81,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"379838\",\"time\":\"2026-03-12T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":93,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34450\",\"name\":\"Sirât\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"sirt\",\"posterImage\":\"yqovdcshp295k39trpfshud8uac7\",\"bannerImage\":\"mdoieqnqsht5wx2juqzk3t29ln01\",\"synopsis\":\"A father (Sergi López) and his son arrive at a rave deep in the mountains of southern Morocco. They are searching for Mar — daughter and sister — who vanished months ago at one of these endless, sleepless parties. Surrounded by electronic music and a raw, unfamiliar sense of freedom, they hand out her photo again and again. Hope is fading, but they push through and follow a group of ravers heading to one last party in the desert. As they venture deeper into the burning wilderness, the journey forces them to confront their own limits.\",\"starring\":\"Sergi López, Bruno Núñez, Jade Oukid, Joshua Liam Henderson, Richard Bellamy, Stefania Gadda, Tonin Janvier\",\"directedBy\":\"Óliver Laxe\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":114,\"genre\":\"\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3_9OkHX8ZiA\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-06\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-06\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465526\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Sirat [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395212\",\"time\":\"2026-03-06T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"395213\",\"time\":\"2026-03-09T17:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34101\",\"name\":\"The Kitchen Brigade [La brigade]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-kitchen-brigade-la-brigade\",\"posterImage\":\"8deu347q6to1ytln2e2my0nj4m3f\",\"bannerImage\":\"fiu9ajhtw2h2ksb9xxusol5bblid\",\"synopsis\":\"French stars Audrey Lamy and François Cluzet lead a fantastic cast in Louis-Julien Petit’s big-hearted feel-good comedy.\\n\\nDisgruntled sous-chef Cathy Marie (Lamy) leaves her job at a high-end gourmet restaurant to pursue her dreams of becoming a head chef at her own restaurant. But when her plans don’t quite work out, she finds herself strapped for cash and with a new job running the cafeteria at the local migrant shelter run by Lorenzo (Cluzet) and Sabine (Chantal Neuwirth).\\n\\nIn charge of a run-down kitchen and needing to make food for hungry young men, Cathy hates her job, but it’s not long before she realises that she can provide valuable life skills – and maybe learn something herself too!\\n\\nCharming, and brilliantly performed by a talented ensemble cast, The Kitchen Brigade packs mouth-watering food, big laughs and a valuable message into its runtime.\",\"starring\":\"Audrey Lamy, François Cluzet, Chantal Neuwirth\",\"directedBy\":\"Louis-Julien Petit\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":97,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y8BOQBf10fk\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-07\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"430558\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"IN THE NGUYEN KITCHEN [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391935\",\"time\":\"2026-03-07T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29179\",\"name\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Turner \\u0026 Constable\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-turner-constable\",\"posterImage\":\"gvuegqj574ym3nh8of9p9yl4c8d2\",\"bannerImage\":\"soio8yatn4pvwdj0bu5dv95e9eed\",\"synopsis\":\"Two of Britain’s greatest painters, J.M.W. Turner and John Constable were also the greatest of rivals.\\nBorn within a year of each other, both used landscape painting to reflect the changing world around them.\\nTate Britain is bringing these two greats together for a groundbreaking exhibition, in London from November 2025 to April 2026, and Exhibition on Screen once again has exclusive and privileged access to bring their extraordinary art and remarkable stories to the big screen in March 2026 so that both can be enjoyed together.\\nDon’t miss this opportunity to see these greats side-by-side, as they so often were in life, on the big screen for the first time.\\nTurner’s blazing sunsets and sublime scenes from his travels and Constable’s idealised depictions of beloved places from home whipped the public of the time into a frenzy of enthusiasm.\\nCritics compared their starkly different styles to a clash of ‘fire and water’.\\nMarking 250 years since their births, this unmissable new documentary explores Turner and Constable’s intertwined lives and legacies alongside the groundbreaking Tate exhibition.\\nDiscover unexpected sides to both artists with intimate views of sketchbooks and personal items and insights from leading experts. This is not to be missed.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"David Bickerstaff\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"fxoVKCss0sg\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"470745\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: TURNER \\u0026amp; CONSTABLE 2026 (EXHIBITION) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362960\",\"time\":\"2026-03-10T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":31,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":70,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362961\",\"time\":\"2026-03-17T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":90,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34095\",\"name\":\"The Bad Guys\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-bad-guys\",\"posterImage\":\"nhr8evk1k2wzdp17kr9z42jin6tt\",\"bannerImage\":\"0203yjf9kgx723k4cw2yceo7et4v\",\"synopsis\":\"When the infamous Bad Guys are finally caught after years of countless heists and being the world’s most-wanted villains, Mr. Wolf brokers a deal to save them all from prison.\",\"starring\":\"Sam Rockwell, Marc Maron, Awkwafina\",\"directedBy\":\"Pierre Perifel\",\"producedBy\":\"Damon Ross, Rebecca Huntley, Patrick Hughes\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":100,\"genre\":\"Animation\",\"allGenres\":\"Animation, Comedy, Action, Family, Crime\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"m8Xt0yXaDPU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-03-17\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":8.1853,\"tmdbId\":\"629542\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"287539\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Bad Guys, The (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393990\",\"time\":\"2026-03-14T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"393991\",\"time\":\"2026-03-15T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29167\",\"name\":\"Dawn of Impressionism: Paris, 1874\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"dawn-of-impressionism-paris-1874\",\"posterImage\":\"gcfa2lhssgduxqmlvh1uvq5sdjlr\",\"bannerImage\":\"jgx682akdussc3zncq9ovep2nm9u\",\"synopsis\":\"The Impressionists are the most popular group in art history - millions flock every year to marvel at their masterpieces. But, to begin with, they were scorned, penniless outsiders.\\n1874 was the year that changed everything; the first Impressionists, “hungry for independence”, broke the mould by holding their own exhibition outside official channels. Impressionism was born and the art world was changed forever.\\nWhat led to that first groundbreaking show 150 years ago? Who were the maverick personalities that wielded their brushes in such a radical and provocative way?\\nThe spectacular Musée d’Orsay exhibition brings fresh eyes to this extraordinary tale of passion and rebellion. The story is told not by historians and curators but in the words of those who witnessed the dawn of Impressionism: the artists, press and people of Paris, 1874.\\nMade in close collaboration with the Musee d’Orsay and National Gallery of Art, Washington D.C.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":92,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"ahXVMZenea0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-18\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-18\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"422140\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874 2025 (Exhibition) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362941\",\"time\":\"2026-03-18T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":31,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":29,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34096\",\"name\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-bad-guys-2\",\"posterImage\":\"rqq1k2r8w3i1bzdbhzj64n99v3g5\",\"bannerImage\":\"hvso0zfsltgf16ce18t5lug2usfw\",\"synopsis\":\"Who’s badder than The Bad Guys? The Bad Girls. \\n\\nIn the new chapter from DreamWorks Animation’s acclaimed 2022 action-comedy hit about a crackerjack criminal crew of animal outlaws, The Bad Guys are struggling to find trust and acceptance in their newly minted lives as Good Guys, when they are pulled out of retirement and forced to do “one last job” by an all-female squad of criminals.\\n\\nBased on the New York Times best-selling book series by Aaron Blabey, The Bad Guys 2 reunites the film’s all-star cast and filmmakers.\",\"starring\":\"Sam Rockwell, Marc Maron, Awkwafina\",\"directedBy\":\"Pierre Perifel\",\"producedBy\":\"Damon Ross\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":104,\"genre\":\"Animation\",\"allGenres\":\"Animation, Family, Crime, Comedy\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"YDGq4N0vILo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":19.9845,\"tmdbId\":\"1175942\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"388746\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"BAD GUYS 2, THE [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391946\",\"time\":\"2026-03-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"391947\",\"time\":\"2026-03-22T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29177\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Tristan Und Isolde\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-tristan-und-isolde\",\"posterImage\":\"540mvout7rx71uwtw6hfw25c1jlx\",\"bannerImage\":\"1e9jmpc4endio7das8w6xels9bs1\",\"synopsis\":\"After years of anticipation, a truly unmissable event arrives in cinemas worldwide on March 21 as the electrifying Lise Davidsen tackles one of the ultimate roles for dramatic soprano: the Irish princess Isolde in Wagner’s transcendent meditation on love and death. Heroic tenor Michael Spyres stars opposite\\nDavidsen as the love-drunk Tristan. The momentous occasion also marks the advent of a new, Met-debut staging by Yuval Sharon—hailed by The New York Times as “the most visionary opera director of his generation” and the first American to direct an opera at the famed Wagner festival in Bayreuth—as well\\nas Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin’s first time leading Tristan und Isolde at the Met. Mezzosoprano Ekaterina Gubanova reprises her portrayal of Brangäne, alongside bass-baritone Tomasz Konieczny, who sings Kurwenal after celebrated Met appearances in Wagner’s Der Fliegende Holländer and Ring cycle. Bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green makes an important role debut as King Marke.\",\"starring\":\"Nina Maria Stemme, Ekaterina Gubanova, Stuart Skelton\",\"directedBy\":\"Mariusz Treliński\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":310,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Music\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"w3Y-BNewUes\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.4638,\"tmdbId\":\"417537\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465749\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"TRISTAN UND ISOLDEÂ - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362955\",\"time\":\"2026-03-21T16:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":33,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":68,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362956\",\"time\":\"2026-03-24T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34454\",\"name\":\"Oscars Best Picture Winner 2026\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"oscars-best-picture-winner-2026\",\"posterImage\":\"d0da4sc7uho2s1ov7nvdt11q2li4\",\"bannerImage\":\"rjamv5suwaknnyucbi3q95832kwg\",\"synopsis\":\"We'll screen the Oscar Best Picture winner after the Oscars ceremony on 15th March, with host Andrea Carnevali in attendance. Max ticket price £12. \\n\\nThis is another chance to dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nNominees:\\nBUGONIA\\nF1\\nFRANKENSTEIN\\nHAMNET\\nMARTY SUPREME\\nONE BATTLE AFTER ANOTHER\\nTHE SECRET AGENT\\nSENTIMENTAL VALUE\\nSINNERS\\nTRAIN DREAMS\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":180,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":null,\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-26\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"395216\",\"time\":\"2026-03-26T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29162\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Siegfried\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-siegfried\",\"posterImage\":\"pzlyuw4qhc4rmbsjp1af2pw74wv5\",\"bannerImage\":\"x6z80ibmz3nlp25k6d44t0kq6ole\",\"synopsis\":\"Raised by a scheming dwarf and unaware of his true family origins, a young man embarks on an epic journey.\\nSoon, destiny brings him face-to-face with a shattered sword, a fearsome dragon and the cursed ring it guards, and a Valkyrie forced into enchanted slumber...\\nMoments of transcendent beauty and heroic triumph sparkle in the third chapter of Wagner’s Ring cycle, brought to life under Barrie Kosky’s inspired eye following his spectacular Das Rheingold (2023) and Die Walküre (2025).\\nAndreas Schager, in his much-anticipated debut with The Royal Opera, stars as Siegfried’s titular hero, alongside Christopher Maltman’s towering Wanderer, Peter Hoare’s treacherous Mime and Elisabet Strid’s radiant Brünnhilde. Antonio Pappano conducts, drawing out the unspoken tensions and ethereal mysticism of Wagner’s dynamic score.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"Peter Hoare, Andreas Schager, Christopher Maltman\",\"directedBy\":\"Barrie Kosky\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":330,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"9B8DfHdFhvM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-31\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-31\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0168,\"tmdbId\":\"1483691\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466190\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SIEGFRIED - ROH, LONDON 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368329\",\"time\":\"2026-03-31T16:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":42,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362934\",\"time\":\"2026-04-06T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"33964\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: All My Sons\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"national-theatre-live-all-my-sons\",\"posterImage\":\"tyhx6ade67c8pix0vpamu44h54vs\",\"bannerImage\":\"zpuuotih4ixgp4yroamzhyf9k33e\",\"synopsis\":\"Bryan Cranston (Breaking Bad) and Marianne Jean-Baptiste (Hard Truths) feature in a five-star, triumphantly acclaimed new production of Arthur Miller’s classic play, from visionary director Ivo Van Hove (A View from the Bridge).\\nOne family, the heart of the American dream. When wartime delivers profits for Joe, it comes at a price when his partner is charged with criminal manufacturing deals, and his eldest son goes missing in action. Will peacetime bring peace of mind, or will he be confronted by the consequence of his actions?\\nFilmed live from the West End, Paapa Essiedu (I May Destroy You), Tom Glynn-Carney\\n(House of the Dragon), and Hayley Squires (I, Daniel Blake) also feature in this disturbingly\\nprescient play.\",\"starring\":\"Bryan Cranston, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Paapa Essiedu, Tom Glynn-Carney, Hayley Squires\",\"directedBy\":\"Ivo Van Hove\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":130,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"3HGScE2B1j4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-04-16\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-04-16\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"477670\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled NT Live Event (16Th Apr 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"390429\",\"time\":\"2026-04-16T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":30,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":71,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390430\",\"time\":\"2026-04-26T15:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390431\",\"time\":\"2026-05-14T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34245\",\"name\":\"Colours of Time [La Venue de l'avenir]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"colours-of-time-la-venue-de-lavenir\",\"posterImage\":\"jf1f59cm8v5tlp0uzee8ifsalhes\",\"bannerImage\":\"cmml3d7gkndz6gsmmazlgnrgln2g\",\"synopsis\":\"Follows the lives of the cousins who inherit an old house in rural Normandy and retrace their steps of their ancestors in 19th century Paris.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":126,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_sTdOm2BID8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-04-18\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-04-18\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"468295\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Colours Of Time (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393319\",\"time\":\"2026-04-18T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29164\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: The Magic Flute\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-the-magic-flute\",\"posterImage\":\"cbx1zilvcx5k6xeoxwk80rv5c0im\",\"bannerImage\":\"05sqp9ye1i70ewckxygu58p6gjo2\",\"synopsis\":\"Princess Pamina has been captured. Her mother, the Queen of the Night, tasks the young Prince Tamino with her daughter’s rescue. But when Tamino and his friendly sidekick, Papageno, embark on their adventure, they soon learn that when it comes to the quest for love, nothing is as it really seems.\\nGuided by a magic flute, they encounter monsters, villains, and a mysterious brotherhood of men – but help, it turns out, comes when you least expect it.\\nMozart’s fantastical opera glitters in David McVicar’s enchanting production. A star cast including Julia Bullock as Pamina, Amitai Pati as Tamino, Huw Montague Rendall as Papageno, Kathryn Lewek as the Queen of the Night, and Soloman Howard as Sarastro, led by French conductor Marie Jacquot in her Covent Garden debut.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"Siobhan Stagg, Mauro Peter, Roderick Williams\",\"directedBy\":\"David McVicar\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7jTbrr-0aEA\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-04-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-04-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.1034,\"tmdbId\":\"507224\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466191\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"MAGIC FLUTE - ROH, LONDON 2026 (OPERA), THE [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363317\",\"time\":\"2026-04-21T17:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":80,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"368330\",\"time\":\"2026-04-27T11:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":17,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":84,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34336\",\"name\":\"Romeo + Juliet\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"romeo-juliet\",\"posterImage\":\"1niigyohexnne38c6yohjpgggz87\",\"bannerImage\":\"y8hzremhrtq9wzamiowt5k5hk1uz\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Nomination Best Art Direction.\\n\\nIn director Baz Luhrmann's contemporary take on William Shakespeare's classic tragedy, the Montagues and Capulets have moved their ongoing feud to the sweltering suburb of Verona Beach, where Romeo and Juliet fall in love and secretly wed. Though the film is visually modern, the bard's dialogue remains.\",\"starring\":\"Leonardo DiCaprio, Claire Danes, Jesse Bradford\",\"directedBy\":\"Baz Luhrmann\",\"producedBy\":\"Baz Luhrmann, Gabriella Martinelli\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Romance\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"8VOAxzgq42A\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1996-11-01\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-04-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":6.0434,\"tmdbId\":\"454\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"8888498\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"William Shakespeare's Romeo + Juliet (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394976\",\"time\":\"2026-04-23T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29182\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Eugene Onegin\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-eugene-onegin\",\"posterImage\":\"gwwhm53zg53sf3vz4lz5mytha425\",\"bannerImage\":\"dpz0gtn39r2170a16jam7y8hfnon\",\"synopsis\":\"Following her acclaimed 2024 company debut in Puccini’s Madama Butterfly, soprano Asmik Grigorian returns to the Met as Tatiana, the lovestruck young heroine in this ardent operatic adaptation of Pushkin. Baritone Igor Golovatenko reprises his portrayal of the urbane Onegin, who realizes his affection for her all too late. The Met’s evocative production, directed by Tony Award–winner Deborah Warner, “offers a beautifully detailed reading of … Tchaikovsky’s lyrical romance” (The Telegraph).\",\"starring\":\"Anna Netrebko, Peter Mattei, Alexey Dolgov\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":245,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"inSbxefaa90\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-02\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0882,\"tmdbId\":\"444451\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465753\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EUGENE ONEGINÂ - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368331\",\"time\":\"2026-05-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":17,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":84,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363321\",\"time\":\"2026-05-05T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":96,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34246\",\"name\":\"[Preview] A Private Life [Vie privée]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"preview-a-private-life-vie-prive\",\"posterImage\":\"edkq6wabjtrw1ayzeszoul67ubqs\",\"bannerImage\":\"itk9brao4gg1y6gay1mpp9xwzc8j\",\"synopsis\":\"An exclusive preview screening.\\n\\nWhen renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the death of one of her patients she is deeply troubled. Convinced that it was murder, she decides to investigate…\",\"starring\":\"Jodie Foster, Daniel Auteuil, Virginie Efira\",\"directedBy\":\"Rebecca Zlotowski\",\"producedBy\":\"Frédéric Jouve\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":107,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Crime, Mystery\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HbIEbJbEpF4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-06\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-16\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":9.2307,\"tmdbId\":\"1290432\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466735\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"393320\",\"time\":\"2026-05-16T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29171\",\"name\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Frida Kahlo\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-frida-kahlo\",\"posterImage\":\"p3hh6o6pd6m1r1moadj6t95eao5f\",\"bannerImage\":\"ru3irwyb1f7l1uk4cpwcvj2d1hoy\",\"synopsis\":\"Frida Kahlo is a phenomenon. She is arguably the world’s favourite female artist – beloved by young and old.\\nExhibition on Screen’s award-winning film – first released during covid to a restricted audience – is back by popular demand with an exciting new addition from the blockbuster transatlantic exhibition from Tate Britain and MFA Houston ‘Frida Kahlo: the Making of an Icon’.\\nBack in the cinemas in May 2026, one month before the Tate exhibition opens, allowing audiences to watch both the film and see the show.\\nWho was Frida Kahlo? Everyone knows her face but who was the woman behind the bright colours, the big brows and the floral crowns?\\nTake a journey through the life of a true icon, discover her art, and uncover the true story of her rebellious, passionate and turbulent life.\\nMaking use of the latest technology to deliver previously unimaginable quality, we take an in- depth look at key works throughout her career.\\nUsing letters Kahlo wrote to guide us, this definitive film reveals her deepest emotions and unlocks the secrets and symbolism contained within her art.\\nExhibition on Screen’s trademark combination of interviews with those who knew her and world experts, commentary and a detailed exploration of her art, combined with new special bonus footage from the 2026 Tate exhibition, delivers a treasure trove of colour and emotion. This personal and intimate film offers privileged access to her works, her home, her studio and highlights the source of her feverish creativity, her resilience and her unmatched lust for life, beauty and revolution.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"sWjex7kfdAg\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"273803\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Frida Kahlo 2020 (Exhibition) (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363316\",\"time\":\"2026-05-19T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":80,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363315\",\"time\":\"2026-05-26T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":96,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34342\",\"name\":\"Dead Poets Society\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"dead-poets-society\",\"posterImage\":\"1zaeor0cmsigvmwvw8wkkx89a78u\",\"bannerImage\":\"xa97m5gx0nqhr9vdot19jzyncryc\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Original Screenplay\\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Picture, Best Actor, Best Director\\n\\nMaverick teacher John Keating returns in 1959 to the prestigious New England boys' boarding school where he was once a star student, using poetry to embolden his pupils to new heights of self-expression.\",\"starring\":\"Robin Williams, Ethan Hawke\",\"directedBy\":\"Peter Weir\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":128,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ye4KFyWu2do\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-20\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"1889\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Dead Poets Society (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394977\",\"time\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"32518\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Playboy Of The Western World\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"national-theatre-live-the-playboy-of-the-western-world\",\"posterImage\":\"wcmywqmqlx0qjimte9he47g0ulnf\",\"bannerImage\":\"wa7v2x4ripi7xsfvvjcnmk3vyt7h\",\"synopsis\":\"Nicola Coughlan (Bridgerton) joins Éanna Hardwicke (The Sixth Commandment) and Siobhán McSweeney (Derry Girls) in John Millington Synge’s riveting play of youth and self-discovery.\\nPegeen Flaherty’s life is turned upside down when a young man walks into her pub claiming that he’s killed his father.\\nInstead of being shunned, the killer becomes a local hero and begins to win hearts, that is until a second man unexpectedly arrives on the scene…\\n\\nFilmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Caitríona McLaughlin directs this darkly funny tale full to\\nthe brim with secrets.\",\"starring\":\"Nicola Coughlan, Éanna Hardwicke, Siobhán McSweeney.\",\"directedBy\":\"Caitríona McLaughlin\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":150,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"PBBNdzzlhbw\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-28\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-28\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"477672\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled NT Live Event (28Th May 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"375802\",\"time\":\"2026-05-28T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":16,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":85,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29180\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: El Último Sueño De Frida Y Diego\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-el-ltimo-sueo-de-frida-y-diego\",\"posterImage\":\"yopmz4rfuxqzmgnf1rp3g9p3259o\",\"bannerImage\":\"6k5xnfb6l84sojewg57yjbemolpo\",\"synopsis\":\"On May 30, the Metropolitan Opera’s 2025–26 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of American composer Gabriela Lena Frank’s first opera, a magical-realist portrait of Mexico’s painterly power couple Frida Kahlo and Diego Rivera, with libretto by Pulitzer Prize–winning playwright Nilo Cruz. Fashioned as a reversal of the Orpheus and Euridice myth, the story depicts Frida, sung by leading mezzo-soprano Isabel Leonard, leaving the underworld on the Day of the Dead and reuniting with Diego, portrayed by baritone Carlos Álvarez. The famously feuding pair briefly relive their tumultuous love, embracing both the passion and the pain before bidding the land of the living a final farewell. Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin conducts the Met-premiere staging of Frank’s opera, a “confident, richly imagined score” (The New Yorker) that “bursts with color and fresh individuality” (Los Angeles Times). The vibrant new production, taking enthusiastic inspiration from Frida and Diego’s paintings, is directed and choreographed by Deborah Colker.\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"Yannick Nézet-Séguin, Deborah Colker\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"XhMyeldBDUI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.1115,\"tmdbId\":\"1479653\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465752\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EL ULTIMO SUENO DE FRIDA Y DIEGO - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368332\",\"time\":\"2026-05-30T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":88,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363319\",\"time\":\"2026-06-02T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34102\",\"name\":\"Wild Foxes\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"wild-foxes\",\"posterImage\":\"ss77l1ydb0o7ivy7b2suq8pp3rag\",\"bannerImage\":\"nqemcfimlbe7sdz8pewlicpjmp3j\",\"synopsis\":\"At a sports boarding school, talented young boxer Camille narrowly survives a fatal accident, saved by his best friend Matteo. After a swift recovery, an inexplicable pain gradually takes hold of him, threatening his dreams of greatness and his relationship with the team. In the ring and in a man’s world, there’s no room for weakness.\",\"starring\":\"Samuel Kircher, Fayçal Anaflous, Jef Jacobs, Anna Heckel, Jean-Baptiste Durand, Hassane Alili, Salahdine El Garchi\",\"directedBy\":\"Valéry Carnoy\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":92,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":null,\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xdSNIPsLoug\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-06-13\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"470596\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Wild Foxes [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391936\",\"time\":\"2026-06-13T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34343\",\"name\":\"One Flew Over The Cuckoo's Nest 50th Anniversary\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"one-flew-over-the-cuckoos-nest-50th-anniversary\",\"posterImage\":\"3rpca6sx6o43yhk46t30f3gzin2k\",\"bannerImage\":\"w1ko65ybm5zhjz51duli64mon25o\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Picture, Best Actor, Best Actress, Best Director, Best Adapted Screenplay \\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Supporting Actor, Best Cinematography, Best Film Editing, Best Music \\n\\nOne Flew Over the Cuckoo’s Nest tells the story of a free-spirited rogue who takes over the ward of a mental hospital by a combination of chutzpah and ingenuity. The film is based on Ken Kesey’s best-selling novel published in 1962. Using the madhouse to symbolize the individual against the system, the story gets its power from its unforgettable ensemble of characters and accretion of details that reveal what life is about inside a mental institution. One Flew Over the Cuckoo’s Nest swept the top five Oscars in 1976, the first film to do so since It Happened One Night in 1934. This Fathom’s Big Screen Classics release includes exclusive insights from Leonard Maltin.\",\"starring\":\"Jack Nicholson, Brad Dourif, Louise Fletcher\",\"directedBy\":\"Miloš Forman\",\"producedBy\":\"Michael Douglas, Saul Zaentz\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":133,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"F4da9uRIg8c\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-17\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-06-17\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":8.7793,\"tmdbId\":\"510\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466493\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"One Flew Over The Cuckoo's Nest (4K Re-Release) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394978\",\"time\":\"2026-06-17T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"32517\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: Les Liaisons Dangereuses\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"national-theatre-live-les-liaisons-dangereuses\",\"posterImage\":\"6gwgu57hre8xtfidvef16xxffb69\",\"bannerImage\":\"9aob8atiycf19ouitl7a3ajsa5bg\",\"synopsis\":\"BAFTA Award-winner Lesley Manville (Phantom Thread) joins Aidan Turner (Rivals) in a striking new staging of Christopher Hampton’s celebrated adaptation of the classic novel, where among the glittering salons of the super-rich, one misstep can mean ruin.\\nMarquise de Merteuil is a master in the art of survival. Alongside the magnetic Vicomte de Valmont, they turn seduction into strategy and weaponise desire. But when their alliance collapses into rivalry, the battle between them threatens to destroy everyone in their path.\\n\\nFilmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Marianne Elliott (Angels in America) directs this thrilling game of love, lies, and social warfare.\",\"starring\":\"Lesley Manville, Aidan Turner\",\"directedBy\":\"Marianne Elliott\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":150,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eDi2LJ0GOYw\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-06-25\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"477673\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Untitled NT Live Event (25Th June 2026) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"375803\",\"time\":\"2026-06-25T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":82,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34104\",\"name\":\"The Stranger [L'étranger]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-stranger-ltranger\",\"posterImage\":\"i2e0454iuz4juq0il7bn764wh6td\",\"bannerImage\":\"vp0ix1dehc67c6009qh0gk3hio88\",\"synopsis\":\"Francois Ozon has adapted a monumental work of literature – The Stranger (also known as The Outsider) by Albert Camus. In 1930s Algeria, the apathetic Meursault (Benjamin Voisin) shows total indifference to life. His emotional detachment leads to a murder, followed by a trial that scrutinises both the crime and his character. Ozon has said: ‘‘The themes in the book could hardly be more topical: an emotionally absent hero detached from the world, confronting our mortality, the individual’s quest for meaning in an increasingly alienating world.” Selected for the oﬃcial competition at the Venice Film Festival and UK-premiered at the London Film Festival.\",\"starring\":\"Benjamin Voisin, Rebecca Marder, Swann Arlaud, Pierre Lottin\",\"directedBy\":\"Francois Ozon\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":122,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":null,\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fV3F2fkevCM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-11\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"999962\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Bashu, The Little Stranger (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"391937\",\"time\":\"2026-07-11T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34345\",\"name\":\"Who's Afraid of Virginia Woolf?\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"whos-afraid-of-virginia-woolf\",\"posterImage\":\"8qhf7mcmk018d2xzi6rr2ra16tdm\",\"bannerImage\":\"2brtktiigykn39rbetk7ei26nbub\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Actress, Best Supporting Actress, Best Cinematography, Best Art Direction, Best Costume Design \\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Picture, Best Actor, Best Supporting Actor, Best Director, Best Adapted Screenplay, Best Sound, Best Film Editing, Best Music \\n\\nEdward Albee's astounding journey into the hell of a stormy marriage blazes with powerhouse performances by Oscar winners Elizabeth Taylor and Sandy Dennis, and Oscar nominees Richard Burton and George Segal.\\n\\nThis taut and explosive drama is filled with suspense and a searing tension that is as compelling and riveting as any film ever to hit the cinema.\",\"starring\":\"Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Burton, George Segal, Sandy Dennis\",\"directedBy\":\"Mike Nichols\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":131,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4vIUGN8CGjE\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"8890083\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Who's Afraid Of Virginia Woolf? (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394979\",\"time\":\"2026-09-03T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34353\",\"name\":\"Fargo\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fargo\",\"posterImage\":\"bqqcrbsbkw3m07h9cslorbkj81lq\",\"bannerImage\":\"fjqbdiye72v8b9hzbdzr8liuy8vn\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Actress, Best Screenplay\\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Picture, Best Supporting Actor, Best Director, Best Cinematography, Best Editing\\n\\nThings go terribly awry when small-time Minnesota car salesman, Jerry Lundegaard, hires two thugs to kidnap his wife. Once people start dying, the very chipper and very pregnant Police Chief Marge Gunderson takes the case. Is she up to the challenge? You betcha.\",\"starring\":\"Frances McDormand, William H. Macy, Steve Buscemi, Peter Stormare, Harve Presnell\",\"directedBy\":\"Joel Coen, Ethan Coen\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":100,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ju75Sd4yAZw\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"329432\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Fargo (25Th Anniversary) (2D) [18]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394980\",\"time\":\"2026-09-23T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34354\",\"name\":\"The Omen\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-omen\",\"posterImage\":\"s1xldiwcublv5yroot1qubwftydh\",\"bannerImage\":\"o95nov4zesjvd481pfodnkuz64kt\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Score\\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Song \\n\\nRobert Thorn, an American diplomat living in Rome, learns that his infant son died moments after birth. Rather than tell his wife Katherine the truth, which he fears would shatter her emotionally, Robert secretly arranges the adoption of another baby through the Catholic church. Years pass and the Thorn's child, Damien, has a happy, normal childhood. Robert is named Ambassador to the Court of Saint James, and the family relocates to a lavish estate in the English countryside. But their seemingly idyllic life begins to change when, during Damien's fifth birthday, the boy's nanny suddenly commits suicide.\\n\\nShortly thereafter, Robert is approached by Father Brennan, who claims he was present at the hospital when Damien's adoption took place. He is convinced that the boy is the son of the Devil, and that only a man named Bugenhagen, who lives in Israel, has the power to kill him. Robert initially believes the priest to be mad, but his faith begins to waiver as everyone around Damien is subjected to a series of freak, horrific incidents.\",\"starring\":\"Gregory Peck, Lee Remick, Harvey Spencer Stephens\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Donner\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":111,\"genre\":\"Horror\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sS-sXcx30O4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-10-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"61260\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"At The Very Last Moment – La Nuit De La Glisse (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394981\",\"time\":\"2026-10-21T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34355\",\"name\":\"Back To The Future\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"back-to-the-future-40th-anniversary\",\"posterImage\":\"r704nxzmjirzi1vzrksx66m6wso5\",\"bannerImage\":\"sydxwbbnpp7wpr46z739qbazj5m5\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Wins Best Effects\\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Song, Best Sound, Best Screenplay\\n\\nEighties teenager Marty McFly is accidentally sent back in time to 1955, inadvertently disrupting his parents' first meeting and attracting his mother's romantic interest. Marty must repair the damage to history by rekindling his parents' romance and - with the help of his eccentric inventor friend Doc Brown - return to 1985.\",\"starring\":\"Michael J. Fox, Christopher Lloyd, Crispin Glover\",\"directedBy\":\"Robert Zemeckis\",\"producedBy\":\"Bob Gale, Neil Canton\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":116,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"ez6WQ7IX72U\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-10-31\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-26\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":18.4385,\"tmdbId\":\"105\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"2196538\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Back To The Future (40Th Anniversary) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394982\",\"time\":\"2026-11-26T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34356\",\"name\":\"When Harry Met Sally\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"when-harry-met-sally\",\"posterImage\":\"9xdpi14kx2x06fw12kskuxzx4yr8\",\"bannerImage\":\"u4jj1pilxttdcaxtdqwhljoj052a\",\"synopsis\":\"Dive into film history and technique with handpicked classics. A friendly introduction and a post-film sociable discussion with film-maker Andrea Carnevali.\\n\\nAcademy Award Nominations Best Screenplay\\n\\nDuring their travel from Chicago to New York, Harry and Sally debate whether or not sex ruins a friendship between a man and a woman. Eleven years later, and they're still no closer to finding the answer.\",\"starring\":\"Billy Crystal, Meg Ryan, Carrie Fisher\",\"directedBy\":\"Rob Reiner\",\"producedBy\":\"Rob Reiner, Andrew Scheinman\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":96,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Romance, Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"k7utaa1Ify4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1989-07-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-12-16\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":7.2711,\"tmdbId\":\"639\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"1284\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"394983\",\"time\":\"2026-12-16T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro ad-free andreas-film-club christmas\\\"}\"}]}]}}}",
